  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "athocle heora cyninge \u00fe\u00e6t he wi\u00f0 hie mehte buton f\u00e6stenne gefeohtan, ne eac Ond se cyning mi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00ferum d\u00e6le on scipum for on Cartainense, & hie ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s forb\u00e6rnnan het & him \u00fe\u00e6r ra\u00f0e f\u00e6sten geworhte, & w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00feonan ut sleande & hienende, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t Hanna, \u00fe\u00e6s Ac hiene Agothocles gefliemde, & his folces ofslog II M, & him \u00e6fterfylgende w\u00e6s o\u00fe V mila to Ond \u00fe\u00e6r o\u00feer f\u00e6sten geworhte, & \u00fe\u00e6r ymbutan w\u00e6s hergende & b\u00e6rnende, \u00fe\u00e6tte Cartainense Ymbe \u00f0one timan \u00fee \u00feiss w\u00e6s, Andra w\u00e6s haten, Agothocles bro\u00f0or, \u00feone he \u00e6t ham on \u00fe\u00e6re & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee hie ham coman, & \u00fe\u00e6t spell cu\u00f0 wear\u00f0 Cartainiensium, swa wurdon hie swa swi\u00fee Swa eac Fefles se cyng mid Cerene his folce hiene eac gesohte. Ac Agothocles gedyde untreowlice wi\u00f0 hiene, \u00fe\u00e6t he hiene on his warum beswac & ofslog, swa Gif he \u00fea \u00fea ane untreow\u00fea ne gedyde, from \u00f0\u00e6m d\u00e6ge he mehte butan gebroce eallra Cartaina On \u00fe\u00e6re hwile \u00fee he \u00feone unr\u00e6d \u00feurhteah, Amicor, Pena cyning, w\u00e6s mid sibbe wi\u00f0 his farende \u00c6fter his dea\u00f0e foran eft Cartainienses an Sicilie mid scipum. \u00dea hie \u00f0\u00e6t geacsedan, \u00fea sendon hie \u00e6fter Piruse, Epira cyninge, & he him sume hwile gef",
